action.outputTail:
fleetd's merge train is the component that lands task work on the default branch. Each task's pull request is placed in a queue, where it is reviewed, rebased onto the current main branch, and held until its CI checks pass; the train then merges it in order. Writers never merge their own pull requests, so the train is the single point that performs merges.

